## 11. Carry-Forward Actions

Support tracking unfinished actions from previous meetings.

When creating a new meeting, display an optional section named **Outstanding Actions from Previous Meetings**.

Allow authorized users to select relevant unfinished tasks and add them to the new meeting's follow-up agenda.

When carrying an action forward:

- Keep its original meeting date.
- Keep the original action ID.
- Preserve the original discussion and responsibility history.
- Link it to the new follow-up meeting.
- Record the follow-up note.
- Keep the current status.
- Do not create duplicate active tasks.

If an action needs a new owner or deadline, allow that update with an audit history.

The same action must remain traceable across all meetings until completion.

